# Game Life

I want my life running with projects, the habits are not the main part but a subbranch of projects. For example, I want 100 kg at bench press. So the app will show me the deadline and I'll gain xp, stuffs with each steps done. I want the app to be able to receive photos and videos and I can then watch them on the app. I don't want my character to move in the game, just me with my stuffs.

Project : 100 kg bench press/ 100 kg deadlift/ 100 kg squat.

Deadline : 31 december

Right now : 65 kg bench press/ 60 kg deadlift/ 60 kg squat

Xp : 50 xp every +5 kgs in any exercises
    100 xp every +10 kgs.
I mean every dizaine is 100 xp.

Habits : gym everyday, I don't know when I'll need rest.
Every streak week is 150 xp. Always put a photo proof.
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Game Life</title>
    <script type="module" src="js/app.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Arthurooo</h1>
        <h2 id="nickname"></h2>
    </header>
    <main>
        <picture>Me</picture>
        <button>Options</button>
        <h2>Projects</h2>
        <h3>Current Projects</h3>
        <button><h3>Gym Monster</h3></button>
        <p>
            100 kgs at bench press, deadlift and squat.
            Deadline : 31 December.
        </p>
    </main>
</body>
</html>import { kgToGo } from "./rules.js";
import { formatLevel } from "./rules.js";

